    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1d049222_1c4205b5",
        "filename": "common/usbc/tbt_alt_mode.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 234,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-18T20:31:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As I mention elsewhere, I\u0027m not fond of the alt mode code peeking at the DPM state in this way. I think it might be better for the alt mode modules to expose to the DPM a function to indicate that exit is being requested. In this case, that function could\n1) set retry_done so that we don\u0027t try to enter again,\n2) set a flag that tbt_entry_failed (perhaps with a different name) could use to print out happy messages instead of error messages, and\n3) change the behavior of tbt_setup_next_vdm to allow starting the exit process if we\u0027re in the middle of the enter process.",
      "revId": "5c55ae120f651194718884b7fe3fd4c61b812068",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "74ba4cd7_921c5a65",
        "filename": "common/usbc/tbt_alt_mode.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 245,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-18T20:31:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This already happened in TBT_ACTIVE.",
      "revId": "5c55ae120f651194718884b7fe3fd4c61b812068",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "87f0018d_722b2aae",
        "filename": "common/usbc/tbt_alt_mode.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 253,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-18T20:31:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is necessary. See my other comments.\n\nBut if it is necessary, I think it should be done unconditionally. If we failed to actually exit the mode (in practice, only because pd_dfp_exit_mode was called incorrectly), then it wouldn\u0027t be appropriate to send another Exit Mode REQ. Even if we did, we probably wouldn\u0027t get another Exit Mode ACK. The way the DPM code works, I don\u0027t think we would even try. So this will be our last chance to do whatever we think we should do here.",
      "revId": "5c55ae120f651194718884b7fe3fd4c61b812068",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
